  "details": "When writing scripts in U#, it sometimes makes sense to use the RequireComponent keyword to make sure a different script is attached. However, doing so throws an apparently harmless build error that spams the console.\n\nIt seems that this is caused by the DestroyImmediate function in the UdonSharpEditorManager\n\nSDK Version: 3.4.1",
